{"results":[{"url":"https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in","title":"Dhuleva VII Babulnath Malabar Hill | 4 & 6 BHK Flats at Mumbai","raw_content":"* [Floor Plan](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Price](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Gallery](#gallery)\n\n![Dhuleva VII  Banner](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/1765256834.jpg)\n\n![Dhuleva VII  Banner](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/1765256848.jpg)\n\nMahaRERA Website\n\n [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/) \n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![P51900052793](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/qr/P51900052793_-09122025061918.jpg)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![A51700026634](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. P51900052793\n\n[![P51900052793](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/qr/P51900052793_-09122025061918.jpg)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. A51700026634\n\n[![A51700026634](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![Dhuleva VII  Banner](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/1765256834.jpg)\n\n![Dhuleva VII  Banner](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/1765256848.jpg)\n\nFor Best Offers Fill Your Details\n\n![Dhuleva Group Developer](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/1678871226.svg)\n\nDhuleva Group\n\nDeveloper\n\n![Babulnath Malabar Hills, Mumbai Location](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/1678871255.svg)\n\nBabulnath Malabar Hills, Mumbai\n\nLocation\n\n# About Dhuleva VII Project\n\n**Dhuleva VII Babulnath Malabar Hill, Mumbai** is a residential project by Dhuleva Group situated in the premium location of Babulnath Malabar Hills, Mumbai, offering **4 & 6 BHK** flats with availability of Jodi Apartments. Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheets, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities, and Specifications. Dhuleva VII Babulnath has an **Iconic Tower** of  **G + 4B + 7 Storeys**. Dhuleva VII Malabar Hill has 4 BHK & 6 BHK configurations with **carpet area** of 4 BHK is 2449 sq.ft -  Price starts ₹ 23 Cr\\* and 6 BHK with a carpet area of 4913 sq.ft - ₹ 46 Cr\\* Onwards. Babulnath Dhuleva VII **RERA No**. is P51900052793. Dhuleva VII Mumbai property focuses on proper design & layout in accordance with the rules of Vastu.\n\nDhuleva VII has **Excellent Connectivity** like Babulnath Temple - 140 m, Iskcon Temple - 0.6 km, Jain Derasar -  0.6 km, Saifee Hospital - 1.7 km, Nana Nani Park - 0.4 km, Hanging Garden - 0.7 km, Cumbala Hospital - 1.3 km, Sir H N Reliance Hospital - 1.6 km, Bombay International School - 0.2 km, Wilson College - 0.6 km, Queen Mary School - 1.4 km, Kamla Nehru Park - 0.8 km, , Orient Club - 0.6 km, Malabar Hill Club - 0.8 km, Mafatal Club - 1.2 km,  and Girgaon Chowpathy- 0.5km.\n\n Dhuleva VII Babulnath Mumbai has Modern **Amenities** like  Swimming Pool, Clubhouse, Party Lawn, Kids’ Play Area, Lap Pool, Gym, Yoga Deck, Gazebo, Meditation Court, Co-working Space, BBQ area, and Walking track.\n\nMalabar Hills Dhuleva VII has **Internal Features** like track sliding windows with mosquito net and invisible safety grill, Sliding door or foldable door for terraces, Glass railing for terrace & balcony. Kitchen - Dado tiles above the platform up to 2 feet, Granite body tile kitchen platform with Stainless steel sink, Flooring - Vitrified tile flooring, and Anti-skid tile flooring in toilets. Concealed plumbing and Jaguar fittings.\n\nDhuleva Malabar Hills **Address -** Malabar Hill Division, Babulnath Road, Mumbai - 400007\n\nDhuleva Group has many **Ongoing, Upcoming and Completed Projects**\n\nThe Ongoing Projects are Dhuleva 232 - Girgaon, Business Bay - Girgaon, Dhuleva 1316 - Girgaon and the Completed projects are 22 Dhuleva - Parel & Utsav - Khargar.\n\n![_ Elevation Image](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/image1765256769.jpg)\n\n## Dhuleva VII Overview\n\n![Project Name](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/image1729333292.svg)\n\nProject Name\n\nDhuleva VII\n\n![Location](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/image1729333246.svg)\n\nLocation\n\nBabulnath Malabar Hills, Mumbai\n\n![Developer Name](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/image1729333232.svg)\n\nDeveloper Name\n\nDhuleva Group\n\n![TOTAL TOWERS](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871433.svg)\n\nTOTAL TOWERS\n\n1\n\n![FLOORS](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871419.svg)\n\nFLOORS\n\nG + 4B + 7 Storey\n\n![APARTMENTS](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871403.svg)\n\nAPARTMENTS\n\n4 & 6 BHK\n\n![AREA](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871390.svg)\n\nAREA\n\n2449 - 4913 Sqft\n\n![POSSESSION](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871368.svg)\n\nPOSSESSION\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![RESEDENTIAL](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871349.svg)\n\nRESEDENTIAL\n\nProperty\n\n## Dhuleva VII Property Specification\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| Dhuleva VII is near to ISKCON temple - 0.6 km, and Babulnath Mandir - 0.4 km, Girgaon Chowpathy- 0.5km, and Hanging Garden- 0.3 km |\n| Covered with Swimming pool, Gazebo, Yoga and Steam Room |\n| 4 & 6 BHK Balcony homes with ample Sunlight and good Ventilation. |\n| Dhuleva VII has 10 + Modern Amenities and Vastu-Compliant Homes |\n\n## Configuration & Price Of Dhuleva VII\n\n| Type | Carpet Area (sq ft) | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|\n| 4 BHK | 2449 Sqft | ₹ 23 Cr\\* |\n|\n| 6 BHK | 4913 Sqft | ₹ 46 Cr\\* |\n\n## Dhuleva VII Floor Plan\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-4-BHK-1st-Floor-2449-Sqft](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-4-BHK-1st-Floor-2449-Sqft_1765257277.jpg)\n\nDhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-4-BHK-1st-Floor-2449-Sqft\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-4-BHK-1-4th-Floor](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-4-BHK-1-4th-Floor_1765257294.jpg)\n\nDhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-4-BHK-1-4th-Floor\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-6-BHK-4913-sqft](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-6-BHK-4913-sqft_1765257307.jpg)\n\nDhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-6-BHK-4913-sqft\n\n## Dhuleva VII Gallery\n\n### Elevation Images\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Elevation-Image](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Elevation-Image-09122025051538.jpg)\n\nDhuleva-VII-Elevation-Image\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Construction-Elevation-Image](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Construction-Elevation-Image-09122025060815.jpg)\n\nDhuleva-VII-Construction-Elevation-Image\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Construction-Image](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Construction-Image-09122025060830.jpg)\n\nDhuleva-VII-Construction-Image\n\n### Sample Flat Photos\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Entrance-Lobby](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Entrance-Lobby-09122025051554.jpg)\n\nDhuleva-VII-Amenities-Entrance-Lobby\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Multipurpose-Court](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Multipurpose-Court-09122025051609.jpg)\n\nDhuleva-VII-Amenities-Multipurpose-Court\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Ramp-Parking](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Ramp-Parking-09122025051626.jpg)\n\nDhuleva-VII-Amenities-Ramp-Parking\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Spa-Area](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Spa-Area-09122025051642.jpg)\n\nDhuleva-VII-Amenities-Spa-Area\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Steam-Room](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Steam-Room-09122025051657.jpg)\n\nDhuleva-VII-Amenities-Steam-Room\n\n#### External Amenities\n\n* Swimming Pool\n* Clubhouse\n* Party Lawn\n* Kids’ Play Area\n* Lap Pool\n* Gym\n* Yoga Deck\n* Gazebo\n* Meditation Court\n* Co-working Space\n* BBQ area\n* Walking track.\n\n#### Internal Features\n\n* Sliding door or foldable door for terraces\n* Glass railing for terrace & balcony. Kitchen - Dado tiles above the platform up to 2 feet\n* Granite body tile kitchen platform with Stainless steel sink\n* Flooring - Vitrified tile flooring\n* Anti-skid tile flooring in toilets. Concealed plumbing and Jaguar fittings.\n\n## Dhuleva VII Walkthrough Video\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![image](https://sevendhuleva-malabarhill.in/public/admin/images/Dhuleva-VII-Developer-icon_-09122025052025.jpg)\n\n## Dhuleva Group\n\n**Dhuleva Group** is a reputed real estate developer known for delivering high-quality residential and commercial projects across Mumbai, with a strong focus on premium locations like **Babulnath and Malabar Hill**. The brand is recognized for its commitment to superior construction standards, innovative design, and timely project delivery, making it a trusted name among homebuyers and investors. With each development, Dhuleva Group aims to create thoughtfully planned spaces that offer comfort, convenience, and long-term value. Their projects reflect modern architecture, sustainable planning, and a customer-centric approach, positioning Dhuleva Group as one of the emerging leaders in Mumbai’s competitive real estate landscape.\n\n### Enquire Now\n\n### Dhuleva VII Construction Status\n\n## Dhuleva VII Location\n\n## Dhuleva VII Sales Gallery / Office Address & Experience Center\n\nMalabar Hill Division, Babulnath Road, Mumbai - 400007\n\n## Dhuleva VII MahaRera\n