uleva VII Key Features\n\n* Dhuleva VII is near to ISKCON temple - 0.6 km, and Babulnath Mandir - 0.4 km\n* Covered with Swimming pool, Gazebo, Yoga and Steam Room\n* 4 & 6 BHK Balcony homes with ample Sunlight and good Ventilation.\n* Dhuleva VII has 10 + Modern Amenities and Vastu-Compliant Homes\n\n## Dhuleva VII Gallery\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Elevation-Image](https://digipaces.com/storage/Dhuleva-VII-Elevation-Image.jpg)\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Steam-Room](https://digipaces.com/storage/Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Steam-Room.jpg)\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Entrance-Lobby](https://digipaces.com/storage/Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Entrance-Lobby.jpg)\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Multipurpose-Court](https://digipaces.com/storage/Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Multipurpose-Court.jpg)\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Ramp-Parking](https://digipaces.com/storage/Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Ramp-Parking.jpg)\n\n![Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Spa-Area](https://digipaces.com/storage/Dhuleva-VII-Amenities-Spa-Area.jpg)\n\n## Dhuleva VII About\n\n**Dhuleva VII Babulnath Malabar Hill, Mumbai** an under-construction project by the well-known developer Dhuleva Group situated in the premium location of Babulnath Malabar Hills, Mumbai, offering **4 & 6 BHK** flats with availability of Jodi Apartments. Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheets, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities, and Specifications. Dhuleva VII Babulnath has an **Iconic Tower** of **G + 4B + 7 Storeys**. Dhuleva VII Malabar Hill has 4 BHK & 6 BHK configurations with **carpet area** of 4 BHK is 2449 sq.ft -  Price starts ₹ 23 Cr\\* and 6 BHK with a carpet area of 4913 sq.ft - ₹ 46 Cr\\* Onwards. Babulnath Dhuleva VII **RERA No**. is P51900052793. Dhuleva VII Mumbai property focuses on proper design & layout in accordance with the rules of Vastu.\n\nDhuleva VII has **Excellent Connectivity** like Queen Mary School - 1.4 km, Kamla Nehru Park - 0.8 km, Cumbala Hospital - 1.3 km, Sir H N Reliance Hospital - 1.6 km, Orient Club - 0.6 km, Malabar Hill Club - 0.8 km, Babulnath Temple - 140 m, Iskcon Temple - 0.6 km, Mafatal Club - 1.2 km, and Jain Derasar -  0.6 km, Saifee Hospital - 1.7 km, Nana Nani Park - 0.4 km, Hanging Garden - 0.7 km, Bombay International School - 0.2 km, Wilson College - 0.6 km\n\n Dhuleva VII Babulnath Mumbai has Modern **Amenities** like  Swimming Pool, Clubhouse, Party Lawn, Kids’ Play Area, Lap Pool, Gym, Yoga Deck, Gazebo, Meditation Court, Co-working Space, BBQ area, and Walking track.\n\n  Malabar Hills Dhuleva VII has **Internal Features** like track sliding windows with mosquito net and invisible safety grill, Sliding door or foldable door for terraces, Glass railing for terrace & balcony. Kitchen - Dado tiles above the platform up to 2 feet, Granite body tile kitchen platform with Stainless steel sink, Flooring - Vitrified tile flooring, and Anti-skid tile flooring in toilets. Concealed plumbing and Jaguar fittings.\n\nDhuleva Malabar Hills **Address -** Malabar Hill Division, Babulnath Road, Mumbai - 400007\n\nDhuleva Group has many **Ongoing, Upcoming and Completed Projects**\n\nThe Ongoing Projects are Dhuleva 232 - Girgaon, Business Bay - Girgaon, Dhuleva 1316 - Girgaon and the Completed projects are 22 Dhuleva - Parel & Utsav - Khargar\n\n## Dhuleva VII Floor Plans\n\n[![4 BH](https://digipaces.com/storage/Dhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-4-BHK-1st-Floor-2449-Sqft.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Dhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-4-BHK-1st-Floor-2449-Sqft.jpg) \n\n**Name:** 4 BH\n\n**Carpet Size:** 2449 Sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹230,000,000.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:**\n\n4 BHK - 2449 Sqft - ₹ 23 Cr\\*\n\n[![6 BHK](https://digipaces.com/storage/Dhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-6-BHK-4913-sqft.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Dhuleva-VII-Floor-Plan-6-BHK-4913-sqft.jpg) \n\n**Name:** 6 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 4913 Sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. 